  "data_payload_hash": "SHA-256 (if payload exists)",
  "verified_channel": "boolean (true only if TLS client cert validated)"
}
```

> **Note**: Any field not present in input is treated as **absent**, not `false` or `null`. No defaults assumed. Behavioral labels such as “suspicious”, “regular user”, or “after-hours” are **prohibited**.

